abstract: >-
  DyniSafety is a dynamic physical safety benchmark for Vision-Language-Action
  (VLA) policies across LIBERO, SimplerEnv, and RoboTwin. Reported scores are
  simulator-internal indices and are not deployment-grade physical safety
  certification.
